<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>-GRPO: Unifying the GRPO Frameworks with Learnable Token Preferences</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
