</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">URL <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.04964" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.04964</a>.

</span></li>
    
</ul>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Limitations</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">First, our experiments focus on <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5</span> base models and do not evaluate cross-family generalization; extending to additional architectures (i.e., Llama) would test robustness and portability. Second, we explore only a small set of reducer values, which control the post-weighting scaling range; exploring a wider range or adaptive schedules of the reducer could potentially improve stability and performance and reveal sensitivity to this hyperparameter.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>The Use of LLMs</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our use of LLMs was limited to grammar and style editing; we did not employ them for research functions (e.g., idea generation). We supplied the original manuscript to OpenAI GPT-5 and asked it to improve clarity and tone to make our work a more professional research paper. All generated text was subsequently checked for factual correctness and fidelity to the source.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Derivation of the proposed objective function</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">According to section <a href="#S2.SS3" title="2.3 Our Learnable Preference ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ 𝜆-GRPO: Unifying the GRPO Frameworks with Learnable Token Preferences" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.3</span></a>,
the objective is</p>
<table id="A3.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{J}(\lambda-GRPO)\;=\;\frac{1}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}f(o_{i})\,L_{i}\;=\;\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}s_{i}\,L_{i}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>G</mi><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{J}(\lambda-GRPO)\;=\;\frac{1}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}f(o_{i})\,L_{i}\;=\;\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}s_{i}\,L_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">, where</p>
<table id="A3.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ L_{i}=\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\min\!\Big(r_{i,t}(\theta)\,\hat{A}_{i,t},\,\mathrm{clip}\big(r_{i,t}(\theta),\,1-\epsilon,\,1+\epsilon\big)\,\hat{A}_{i,t}\Big)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover><mrow><mpadded style="width:1.653em;" width="1.653em"><mi>min</mi></mpadded><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>clip</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn> 1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ L_{i}=\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\min\!\Big(r_{i,t}(\theta)\,\hat{A}_{i,t},\,\mathrm{clip}\big(r_{i,t}(\theta),\,1-\epsilon,\,1+\epsilon\big)\,\hat{A}_{i,t}\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Here, we show the detailed gradient derivation with respect to <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>. 
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">First, we want to calculate <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g_{i}=h_{i}^{\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g_{i}=h_{i}^{\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We can substitute <math id="A3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{i}^{\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{i}^{\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and</p>
<table id="A3.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial(e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}})}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{\partial(e^{\lambda\cdot\ln{h_{i}}})}{\partial\lambda}=e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}}\cdot\ln{h_{i}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial(e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}})}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{\partial(e^{\lambda\cdot\ln{h_{i}}})}{\partial\lambda}=e^{\ln{h_{i}^{\lambda}}}\cdot\ln{h_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Hence,</p>
<table id="A3.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;=\;\frac{\partial}{\partial\lambda}\big(h_{i}^{\lambda}\big)=h_{i}^{\lambda}\cdot\ln{h_{i}}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;=\;\frac{\partial}{\partial\lambda}\big(h_{i}^{\lambda}\big)=h_{i}^{\lambda}\cdot\ln{h_{i}}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Then, we will take softmax derivative <math id="A3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math>, where
<math id="A3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> = <math id="A3.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="false"><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Let</p>
<table id="A3.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\;=\;\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z},\qquad Z\;=\;\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.391em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\;=\;\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z},\qquad Z\;=\;\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p6.2" class="ltx_p">Then, by the quotient rule,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial\lambda}\!\left(\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial\lambda}\!\left(\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{e^{g_{i}}\,\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\,Z\;-\;e^{g_{i}}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}}{Z^{2}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.502em" rspace="0.502em">−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{e^{g_{i}}\,\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\,Z\;-\;e^{g_{i}}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}}{Z^{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p6.3" class="ltx_p">Using <math id="A3.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}=\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}=\frac{e^{g_{i}}}{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>, we rewrite</p>
<table id="A3.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=s_{i}\left(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;-\;\frac{1}{Z}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.502em" rspace="0.502em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=s_{i}\left(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;-\;\frac{1}{Z}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p6.4" class="ltx_p">Moreover,</p>
<table id="A3.EGx6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{1}{Z}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{1}{Z}\,\frac{\partial Z}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z}\sum_{j=1}^{G}\frac{\partial e^{g_{j}}}{\partial g_{j}}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{1}{Z}\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\sum_{j=1}^{G}\frac{e^{g_{j}}}{Z}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup><mi>Z</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{Z}\sum_{j=1}^{G}\frac{\partial e^{g_{j}}}{\partial g_{j}}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{1}{Z}\sum_{j=1}^{G}e^{g_{j}}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\sum_{j=1}^{G}\frac{e^{g_{j}}}{Z}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}=\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\,\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p6.5" class="ltx_p">Substituting back gives the desired result:</p>
<table id="A3.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;=\;s_{i}\left(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}\right)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}\;=\;s_{i}\left(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A3.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(o_{i})=G\,s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(o_{i})=G\,s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A3.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial f(o_{i})}{\partial s_{i}}\;=\;G" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial f(o_{i})}{\partial s_{i}}\;=\;G</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Therefore, according to the Chain Rule,</p>
<table id="A3.Ex9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex9X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex9X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial\mathcal{J}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial\mathcal{J}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex9X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\,\frac{\partial f(o_{i})}{\partial s_{i}}\cdot\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\,\frac{\partial f(o_{i})}{\partial s_{i}}\cdot\frac{\partial s_{i}}{\partial\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex9Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex9Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\left[\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\cdot s_{i}\Big(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}\Big)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>G</mi><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\left[\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\cdot s_{i}\Big(\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}\frac{\partial g_{j}}{\partial\lambda}\Big)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p8.2" class="ltx_p">Plugging in <math id="A3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}=h_{i}^{\lambda}\ln h_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\partial g_{i}}{\partial\lambda}=h_{i}^{\lambda}\ln h_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> yields</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A3.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\boxed{\frac{\partial\mathcal{J}}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\left[\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\cdot s_{i}\Big(h_{i}^{\lambda}\ln h_{i}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}h_{j}^{\lambda}\ln h_{j}\Big)\right]}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><menclose notation="box"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mi>G</mi><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>λ</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></menclose><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\boxed{\frac{\partial\mathcal{J}}{\partial\lambda}=\frac{G}{\sum_{i=1}^{G}|o_{i}|}\left[\sum_{i=1}^{G}L_{i}\cdot s_{i}\Big(h_{i}^{\lambda}\ln h_{i}-\sum_{j=1}^{G}s_{j}h_{j}^{\lambda}\ln h_{j}\Big)\right]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Chat Template</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we present the chat template used during training.
The template follows the format of role-tagged messages, with system instructions, user input, and assistant output.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="94.19" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 94.19" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,94.19) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#CCCCFF;" fill="#CCCCFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.7 L 0 85.48 C 0 90.29 3.9 94.19 8.7 94.19 L 541.3 94.19 C 546.1 94.19 550 90.29 550 85.48 L 550 8.7 C 550 3.9 546.1 0 541.3 0 L 8.7 0 C 3.9 0 0 3.9 0 8.7 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E6E6FF;" fill="#E6E6FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 8.7 L 0.83 72.35 L 549.17 72.35 L 549.17 8.7 C 549.17 4.36 545.64 0.83 541.3 0.83 L 8.7 0.83 C 4.36 0.83 0.83 4.36 0.83 8.7 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.69 79.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.84em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="454.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
